        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You need a tin that can be divided into two equal sections for baking the two colours separately. Fold a strip of thick foil down the centre of a square tin to create a divider. Alternatively, use two small loaf tins of identical size. The sponge must be trimmed into precise rectangles -- a ruler and a sharp knife are not excessive here."
          }
        ]
      },
